{"3057240": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Companions of Victory!", "steam_appid": 3057240, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>YOU ARE LOCKED IN WITH 50 PLAYER PLATOON!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057240/extras/a80626d96457dac2f8e8e28e482bab98.poster.avif?t=1784258011\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057240/extras/a80626d96457dac2f8e8e28e482bab98.webm?t=1784258011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057240/extras/a80626d96457dac2f8e8e28e482bab98.mp4?t=1784258011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The &quot;Team Proximity System&quot; anchors everyone to the Commander - So you move together as one Massive, Team Oriented Unit. This creates Explosive Platoon vs Platoon Battles. Now Medics are always with you ready to Heal. Squad Leaders ready to Call out Enemy Positions. Engineers ready to Build. Finally a system built for True Communication and Coordination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>MOVE AS ONE - PREPARE YOUR INVENTORY!</strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057240/extras/17fab3858c848953a8184a4d55d92752.poster.avif?t=1784258011\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057240/extras/17fab3858c848953a8184a4d55d92752.webm?t=1784258011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057240/extras/17fab3858c848953a8184a4d55d92752.mp4?t=1784258011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Load up your APC with Rockets, Machine Guns, Food, Water, Ammo, Medical Supplies and more for the road ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>CONSTRUCT DEFENSIVE FIGHTING POSITIONS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057240/extras/c12b85f05365dba5df615925d33d8c20.poster.avif?t=1784258011\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057240/extras/c12b85f05365dba5df615925d33d8c20.webm?t=1784258011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057240/extras/c12b85f05365dba5df615925d33d8c20.mp4?t=1784258011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build defensive objects, mortar and machine gun nests to maximize your firepower on the field. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>OPEN FIRE AND SUPPRESS THE ENEMY!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057240/extras/acaf1953dbe0093bc27760abdc1b5fd2.poster.avif?t=1784258011\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057240/extras/acaf1953dbe0093bc27760abdc1b5fd2.webm?t=1784258011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057240/extras/acaf1953dbe0093bc27760abdc1b5fd2.mp4?t=1784258011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spot the enemy and order a volley of fire, creating a blistering suppressing fire effect on the enemy. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <strong>PROVIDE CRITICAL MEDICAL SUPPORT UNDER ENEMY FIRE!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057240/extras/d59504c0780d02d25b1a152b78483118.poster.avif?t=1784258011\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057240/extras/d59504c0780d02d25b1a152b78483118.webm?t=1784258011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057240/extras/d59504c0780d02d25b1a152b78483118.mp4?t=1784258011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Injured players will need a variety of medical tools including Morphine, IV drip, Cavity Packing, Surgical Forceps and Antibiotic Syringes. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>RELAY ENEMY COORDINATES FOR HEAVY FIRE SUPPORT!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057240/extras/8e6c3c9079aafb0fe76dcc90824c11bd.poster.avif?t=1784258011\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057240/extras/8e6c3c9079aafb0fe76dcc90824c11bd.webm?t=1784258011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057240/extras/8e6c3c9079aafb0fe76dcc90824c11bd.mp4?t=1784258011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locate enemy positions and yell target coordinates to the Radio Operator to call in Artillery and Air Support. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>PERFORM FIELD REPAIRS ON DAMAGED EQUIPMENT!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057240/extras/f64aa505ea19eea9395b7c63628c83c1.poster.avif?t=1784258011\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057240/extras/f64aa505ea19eea9395b7c63628c83c1.webm?t=1784258011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057240/extras/f64aa505ea19eea9395b7c63628c83c1.mp4?t=1784258011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a variety of tools to repair or construct vehicles and objectives. Including Socket Wrench, Welder, Needle Nose, Hammer and Adjustable Wrench. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>RANDOMLY GENERATED BATTLEFIELD EVERY MATCH!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057240/extras/c1950ad8011b309211f54c86593af4d3.poster.avif?t=1784258011\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057240/extras/c1950ad8011b309211f54c86593af4d3.webm?t=1784258011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057240/extras/c1950ad8011b309211f54c86593af4d3.mp4?t=1784258011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Never play the same map again. Spawn into a brand new procedurally generated battlefield every time. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>ATTACK UNDER NIGHTFALL WITH A FULL DAY NIGHT CYCLE!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https: